//
// Payload: libandroidfw (frameworks/base/libs/androidfw), libprotoutil
// (frameworks/base/libs/protoutil), libincfs + libincfs-utils
// (system/incremental_delivery/incfs), libutils (system/core/libutils).
//
// libutils is NOT declared here: prebuilts_target_core
// (prebuilts/target/system/core) already owns the libutils / libutils_headers
// module names; re-declaring them would be a Soong duplicate-module error.
// lib64/libutils.so is staged for runtime fidelity only.
//
// Generated by tools/gen_extractive_bp.py, hand-aligned against the source
